/// the value to the customer name or ID. You can specify one or more tags
/// to add to each AWS resource, up to 50 tags for a resource. Tagging is
/// only available through the API, SDKs, and CLI. You can't manage or view
/// tags through the AWS WAF Classic console. You can tag the AWS resources
/// that you manage through AWS WAF Classic: web ACLs, rule groups, and
/// rules.
